      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOYAL LOU NZ (3) has drawn wide in two Menangle outings since he led to win at this circuit and distance last month. Has the speed to take advantage of this lower barrier and looks better placed. NOTHINGBUTWAVES (10) continued her good form when she came from this row and finished second at this circuit and distance last week, beaten just a head. That was her fourth minor placing from her last five appearances so her hoof is on the till. ROCKET RALPH (1) had a tough barrier last time but led from this barrier and fought well to win two back at this circuit and distance. Can give a big sight again. MAJOR ICON NZ (8) may need some luck from this draw but turned in a good effort last start to finish second.",
